@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@customerId = REPLACE_WITH_ID_FROM_CREATE_RESPONSE

### Create a simulated customer (change code/email when repeating)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: customer-demo-001

{
  "customerCode": "KH001",
  "fullName": "Nguyễn Văn An",
  "email": "an@example.com",
  "phone": "0912345678"
}

### List/search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers?page=0&size=20&search=KH
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update contact
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "an.moi@example.com"
}

### Clear phone
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone": ""}

### Validation example: size exceeds maximum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers?size=101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
